            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "12. In the event the recipient resigns from the District within said five (5) year period, then such event will accelerate the maturity of the entire note, the same as if it had been specified in such note for it to mature on that date. In the event of the recipient's death, disability or dismissal, the balance (principle and interest) due shall be cancelled in full without any further payment.",
