        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. If the work week for the summer session is modified from a normal five-day work week to a compressed four-day work week, the following contractual variations shall apply to Secondary School teachers. Adult Vocational School teachers, bargaining unit administrative office employees, and Bargaining unit 12-month employees:",
