            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The full day shall be 9 hours and 22 minutes in length with the required on-site portion of the day to be 8 hours and 30 minutes consecutively. This will include a 30-minute duty-free lunch. Teachers are permitted to leave the worksite during their duty-free lunch. The one-half day will be 4 hours and 41 minutes in length with the required on-site duty portion of the day to be 4 hours consecutively excluding lunch.",
